# Float lexemes in the pipeline outs: mrp's _outs keeps each number as its
# writer spelled it (1e+21, 1e-07, -0.0, and -0 for the -0.0 literal it
# passes on), and pipeline_outs.json must too. Nextflow's workflow-output
# index re-spells them (1E+21, 0.0), so it cannot write that file (#612,
# TestWorkflowIndexRespellsNumbers). TestMrpDiffFloatOverride launches pz
# as 0 against mrp running override_zero.mro, whose literal is that value.
@include "floats.mro"

call P(
    pz   = -0.0,
    pbig = 1e21,
)
